  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejora de la Calidad de la Gestin y del Gasto Pblico III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Expenditure Management Quality III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">La presente operacin de prstamo es la tercera de tres consecutivas de un slo tramo cada una, vinculadas tcnicamente entre s, pero financiadas en forma independiente bajo la modalidad de prstamo programtico de apoyo a reformas de poltica, de conformidad con los documentos CA-450-1, CS-3633, y el Memorando EVP12006 (PO LO-2006) de fecha 6 de marzo del 2006.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present loan operation is the third one of the three consecutive, linked technically between them, but financed in independent form under the programmatic loan of support to reforms of politics, in accordance with the documents CA-450-1, CS-3633, and the Memorandum EVP12006 (PO LO-2006) of date March 6, 2006. To keep on supporting the Government of Peru in the institutional, operative, legal and normative changes to improve the quality of the management and of the public expenditure, from the strengthening of the governmental capacities of analysis and monitoring linked to normative topics, budget, of public investment, and administrative management; as well as the promotion of a major participation of the private sector associated with the public sector in the investment and in the provision of services.</narrative>
  </description>
